ier "}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"type": "", "content": "has changed a lot in the last few decades."}}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "type": "GIW", "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Tell me about the dress code."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions:\n<span class=\"bullet\">Listen to the audio. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.</span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary. </span>"}]}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>: Hello, how can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Hello, could you tell me where the men's attire is, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>: Yes, of course. It's right over here. Are you buying an outfit for a special occasion?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I have a job interview next week. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Oh, congratulations. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Would you be able to help me choose a tie?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Nothing would make me happier. What color is your suit and shirt?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: I will be wearing a black suit with a light blue shirt.<br>", "id": 1}, {"time": "36000", "image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>: That's a nice combination. The color and design of your tie is more than just a fashion statement, it gives people insight into your attitude and personality. You'll want to choose one carefully. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Do you have a large selection?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  We have the largest selection of ties in the city. With a black suit, it's easy to choose a tie that matches. Have you chosen a color? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Not really.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Consider red. It is known as the \u201cpower tie\u201d. You will be viewed as determined, intelligent and powerful. You'll make an excellent first impression. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>:  I'm not sure if I am determined, intelligent and powerful.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Maybe blue would be a better choice. It says you are trustworthy, confident and mature. That's good at a job interview.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Can you tell me what you think about black?  <br>", "id": 2}, {"time": "94000", "image": "engenn9le13ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Certainly. A black tie is also a good option. It suggests you are classy, serious and dignified.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Is there anything that says I am desperate and willing to do anything for this job?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Salesclerk</span>:  Oh, come on!  You need to have more confidence in yourself! By this time next week, you will have proven to everyone that you are the best person for the job! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Well, by this time next week I will have chosen a tie, in any case.<br>", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}